sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Checkout Page
    participant EF1 as create-razorpay-order
    participant RZP as Razorpay
    participant EF2 as verify-razorpay-payment
    participant WH as razorpay-webhook
    participant DB as Postgres
    U->>FE: Confirm order (challenge + ticket + coupon)
    FE->>EF1: {challengeId, ticketId, couponCode}
    EF1->>DB: insert orders (status=created)
    EF1->>RZP: create order (amount, currency)
    RZP-->>EF1: razorpay_order_id
    EF1-->>FE: {orderId, keyId}
    FE->>RZP: open Checkout modal
    RZP-->>FE: {payment_id, signature}
    FE->>EF2: verify signature
    EF2->>EF2: HMAC-SHA256 verify
    EF2->>DB: update orders (paid) + insert registrations
    EF2-->>FE: success -> redirect to /my-challenges/:id
    RZP-->>WH: async webhook (idempotent safety net)
    WH->>DB: reconcile if verify missed
